    "detailed_description": "<strong>POOOOL is a small, pool-inspired physics-based puzzler where you combine pool balls of matching size and color to create bigger ones! Combining balls increases your score, but if the table gets too full and you run out of room, it's game over. Use only your mouse to control the angle and power of every shot!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/03af997b7632bc539ac4ba81aa6f1571.avif?t=1718169353\" width=592 height=84 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u26aa Create combos and perform bank shots with satisfying physics interactions!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd34 Choose the power and angle of each fling! Click and drag anywhere on the screen!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udfe0 Control the entire game with ease and comfort using just your mouse.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udfe1 Charming and customizable backgrounds and faces.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udfe2 Compete against yourself to beat your hi-score!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd35 Share your scores with custom postcard snapshots. Share with friends!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udfe3 Every round is different \u2014 endlessly replayable!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/6031030af4100cdf62d81fe8a202fc78.avif?t=1718169353\" width=592 height=84 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/38795d0640cd1abb9f89bc449f1fda0f.poster.avif?t=1718169353\" width=338 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/38795d0640cd1abb9f89bc449f1fda0f.webm?t=1718169353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/38795d0640cd1abb9f89bc449f1fda0f.mp4?t=1718169353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u26aa Click and hold where you want the \u25bc ball to go, then drag your mouse to choose the angle and power!<br></li><li> \ud83d\udd34 You can click anywhere on the screen! The further you drag, the more power you'll fling the ball with.<br></li><li> \ud83d\udfe0 After dragging, release to fling the \u25bc ball!<br></li><li> \ud83d\udfe1 If two balls of the same color and size collide, they combine into a bigger one.<br></li><li> \ud83d\udfe2 Each match adds to your score. The bigger the ball, the higher the score!<br></li><li> \ud83d\udd35 The meter shows how full the play area is. Once it reaches 75% full, it's game over!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>POOOOL is a small, pool-inspired physics-based puzzler where you combine pool balls of matching size and color to create bigger ones! Combining balls increases your score, but if the table gets too full and you run out of room, it's game over. Use only your mouse to control the angle and power of every shot!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/03af997b7632bc539ac4ba81aa6f1571.avif?t=1718169353\" width=592 height=84 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u26aa Create combos and perform bank shots with satisfying physics interactions!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd34 Choose the power and angle of each fling! Click and drag anywhere on the screen!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udfe0 Control the entire game with ease and comfort using just your mouse.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udfe1 Charming and customizable backgrounds and faces.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udfe2 Compete against yourself to beat your hi-score!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd35 Share your scores with custom postcard snapshots. Share with friends!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udfe3 Every round is different \u2014 endlessly replayable!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/6031030af4100cdf62d81fe8a202fc78.avif?t=1718169353\" width=592 height=84 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/38795d0640cd1abb9f89bc449f1fda0f.poster.avif?t=1718169353\" width=338 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/38795d0640cd1abb9f89bc449f1fda0f.webm?t=1718169353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935840/extras/38795d0640cd1abb9f89bc449f1fda0f.mp4?t=1718169353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u26aa Click and hold where you want the \u25bc ball to go, then drag your mouse to choose the angle and power!<br></li><li> \ud83d\udd34 You can click anywhere on the screen! The further you drag, the more power you'll fling the ball with.<br></li><li> \ud83d\udfe0 After dragging, release to fling the \u25bc ball!<br></li><li> \ud83d\udfe1 If two balls of the same color and size collide, they combine into a bigger one.<br></li><li> \ud83d\udfe2 Each match adds to your score. The bigger the ball, the higher the score!<br></li><li> \ud83d\udd35 The meter shows how full the play area is. Once it reaches 75% full, it's game over!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "POOOOL is a small, pool-inspired physics puzzler where you combine balls of similar sizes to create even bigger ones, all while trying to save room for more. Chase your hi-score, share scores with friends, and master your flinging skills!",
